# AprilTag detection views for the maze (MZ-018). In the RemoteRobot scene, type:
#   call Includes/AprilTagViews
# Needs the robot to run the Maze scenario and the "upper" image view of RemoteRobot (Includes/JPEGImageViews).

# Tag outline and id on the upper camera image.
vid upper module:AprilTagDetector:tags

# Tags in the robot frame (bar = tag, arrow = its normal) in a field view, with the number as text.
vf aprilTags
vfd aprilTags representation:AprilTagPercept:field

# Print the current detections (id, corners, pose in the robot frame, decision margin) once.
# Repeat this line to see the tags again, or: for Upper get representation:AprilTagPercept
for Upper get representation:AprilTagPercept
